  "content": "\n\n<h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XLhWGhC.png\" alt=\"Title\"/></h1>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/different-textures-for-enchanted-books\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/452537?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/different-textures-for-enchanted-books\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/different-textures-for-enchanted-books?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">该资源包为每一本附魔书提供了独特的纹理，让你一目了然地轻松找到所需的那一本。每本书的封面颜色都根据附魔类型及其可附魔的物品进行主题配色，帮助你在背包或储物空间中快速整理和识别它们。</p></center>\n <ul>\n  <li><strong>1.21.5 及以上版本</strong> 无需安装任何额外模组</li>\n  <li><strong>1.20.5 至 1.21.3 版本</strong> 建议使用 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-enchanted-books-hotfix\">CIT: Hotfix for Enchanted Books</a></li>\n  <li><strong>1.13 至 1.20.4 版本</strong> 请使用支持 CIT 标准的模组，如 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn\">CIT Resewn</a> 或 <a href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\">Optifine</a></li>\n  <li>你也可以将其作为 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanted-books-from-mars\">独立模组</a> 运行</li>\n</ul> \n<center>\n<br />\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">新纹理示例</h2>\n<p>资源包 <b>开启</b><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ClzoG9Q.png\" width=\"460\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gF6wPij.png\" width=\"460\" /></p>\n<p>资源包 <b>关闭</b><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/buQW2Sc.png\" width=\"460\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qg9kIju.png\" width=\"460\" /></p>\n</center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
